    "enUS": {
      "description": "Listen, {class}, you'd best not be hangin' round here for long. But since you are, perhaps you can do a little favor for me?\r\n\r\nI be expecting a certain something from a Jediga, in Azshara. She and some orcs be havin' a camp out there. Go and tell her Jes'rimon sent you, and I'll owe you one.",
      "summary": "Speak to Jediga in Azshara.",
      "title": "Remote Contact",
      "translationMetadata": {
        "fields": {
